e}</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"inline-block text-sm text-muted-foreground\">{member.role}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t{/each}\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n",
